          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: সন্তান",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সন্তান — sôntān — \"a child (as offspring); offspring\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "আমার কাকার দুই সন্তান। āmār kākār dui sôntān. My uncle has two children."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
