          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "সন্তান (sôntān) is a tatsama, Sanskrit saṃtāna, \"continued succession\", and so \"offspring\" (Monier-Williams): what carries the family on."
            }
          ]
        },
